            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Crescent Capital BDC (CCAP) Earnings Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The quarter-over-quarter decline was primarily due to unrealized and realized losses stemming from certain portfolio companies that have demonstrated weakened operating outlooks due to tariffs.  On new investment opportunities, our private credit platform continues to maintain lead roles in the majority of our transactions.  Given our focus on the core and lower middle markets, we believe we drive better structural protections than deals in the more competitive upper middle market or BSL replacement segment.",
